          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "Sudoku is by far the most popular Japanese logic puzzle. Although number placement puzzles existed earlier, Nikoli popularized the modern version in the 1980s and gave it the name Sudoku, meaning single number. It went on to become a worldwide newspaper and app staple. Among puzzle enthusiasts, Shikaku, Kakuro, and Slitherlink are also much loved Nikoli originals."
